<view class="page learning-page">
  <view class="learning-kicker">RIDE WITH UNDERSTANDING</view><view class="learning-title">安全知识练习</view>
  <view class="learning-intro">了解骑行规则，练习安全知识。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载练习记录…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !member}}" class="card learning-panel"><view class="card-title">保存自己的练习进度</view><view class="small muted mt">登录后可继续上次练习。答题记录只供本人及授权业务使用。</view><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="profile">前往登录</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{member}}">
    <view wx:if="{{!practice}}" class="card learning-panel"><view class="learning-bank-name">{{catalog.title || '安全知识练习'}}</view><view class="learning-meta">每次 20 题 · 答案确认后保存</view><view wx:if="{{catalog.fixtureOnly}}" class="notice">样例练习题，仅用于熟悉操作。活动考核以指导人员核定的内容为准。</view><view wx:if="{{!catalog.configured}}" class="learning-empty">负责人正在准备练习内容，发布后可开始。</view><button wx:if="{{catalog.configured}}" class="primary full mt" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">开始练习</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{displayQuestion}}" class="card learning-question"><view class="learning-question-top"><text>第 {{questionNumber}} / {{practice.total}} 题</text><text>{{practice.answeredCount}} 题已保存</text></view><view class="learning-progress"><view class="learning-progress-fill" style="width: {{progress}}%;"></view></view><view class="learning-prompt">{{displayQuestion.prompt}}</view><button wx:for="{{displayQuestion.options}}" wx:key="index" class="learning-option {{selectedIndex === index ? 'is-selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="select" disabled="{{busy || feedback}}"><text class="learning-option-letter">{{optionLabels[index]}}</text><text class="learning-option-copy">{{item}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{feedback}}" class="learning-feedback {{feedback.correct ? 'is-correct' : ''}}"><view class="card-title">{{feedback.correct ? '这道题答对了' : '看看这道题的说明'}}</view><view class="small mt">答案：{{feedback.rightText}}</view><view class="small muted mt">{{feedback.explanation}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{!feedback}}" class="primary full mt" bindtap="answer" disabled="{{busy || selectedIndex === -1}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认答案并保存</button><button wx:else class="primary full mt" bindtap="next">{{practice.status === 'completed' ? '查看本次结果' : '下一题'}}</button><view class="learning-footnote">进度已保存。下次打开可继续当前练习。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{practice.status === 'completed' && !displayQuestion}}" class="card learning-result"><view class="learning-result-label">本次练习已完成</view><view class="learning-result-score">{{practice.correctCount}}<text>/ {{practice.total}}</text></view><view class="small muted">答对题数</view><view class="learning-result-note">这是一份知识练习记录。是否满足活动资格，仍以负责人核定和本场要求为准。</view><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}">再练习一次</button><button class="secondary full mt" bindtap="skills">查看基础技能项目</button></view>
    <view class="learning-policy">练习内容版本 {{practice ? practice.bankRevision : catalog.revision || 0}} · 考核与准入标准待主理人确认</view>
  </block>
  <button wx:if="{{isOwner}}" class="secondary full mt" bindtap="toggleEditor">{{editor ? '收起题库维护' : '维护题库与发布状态'}}</button>
  <view wx:if="{{editor && bank}}" class="card learning-panel learning-editor"><view class="card-title">题库维护</view><view class="small muted mt">{{bank.questions.length}} 题 · {{bank.published ? '已发布' : '草稿'}} · v{{bank.revision}}</view><view class="notice">保存题目会暂停新的练习。至少二十题，经指导人员核定后再发布；已开始的练习保留原版本。</view><picker wx:if="{{questionLabels.length}}" range="{{questionLabels}}" bindchange="chooseQuestion"><view class="picker">选择已有题目修改 ›</view></picker><button class="text-button mt" bindtap="newQuestion">＋ 新增一道题</button><view class="field"><text class="field-label">题目编号</text><input value="{{draft.id}}" data-field="id" bindinput="field" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如 club-001"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">题目</text><textarea value="{{draft.prompt}}" data-field="prompt" bindinput="field" maxlength="400"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选项 A</text><input value="{{draft.option0}}" data-field="option0" bindinput="field" maxlength="160"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选项 B</text><input value="{{draft.option1}}" data-field="option1" bindinput="field" maxlength="160"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选项 C</text><input value="{{draft.option2}}" data-field="option2" bindinput="field" maxlength="160"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">选项 D</text><input value="{{draft.option3}}" data-field="option3" bindinput="field" maxlength="160"/></view><picker range="{{optionLabels}}" value="{{draft.rightIndex}}" bindchange="rightAnswer"><view class="picker">正确答案：{{optionLabels[draft.rightIndex]}} ›</view></picker><view class="field"><text class="field-label">答案说明</text><textarea value="{{draft.explanation}}" data-field="explanation" bindinput="field" maxlength="600"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">核定／变更依据</text><textarea value="{{reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="field" maxlength="500" placeholder="记录指导人员核实情况与本次调整原因"/></view><button class="secondary full" bindtap="saveQuestion" disabled="{{busy}}">保存题目为草稿</button><checkbox-group bindchange="instructor"><label class="check-line mt"><checkbox value="confirmed" checked="{{instructorConfirmed}}" color="#ff6b00"/><text>题目、答案和说明已由指导人员核定</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary full mt" bindtap="publish" disabled="{{busy}}">{{bank.published ? '暂停新练习' : '发布这份题库'}}</button></view>
</view>
